.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH signstar-request-signature 1  "signstar-request-signature " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
signstar\-request\-signature \- Command line arguments for signing
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsignstar\-request\-signature\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Command line arguments for signing
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
signstar\-request\-signature\-prepare(1)
Prepare signing request for a file
.TP
signstar\-request\-signature\-send(1)
Send signing request over SSH
.TP
signstar\-request\-signature\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
